g to try to keep the group to around 4 at a time, but since I don't know when I and other players will be available the schedule is pretty flexible. Hit me up if you want to talk characters and times. Alternatively, you can join the Discord just to look for other people who want to play games, I'm more than happy to hand out the link in PM.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-11T16:26:44-07:00","id":1076699,"title":"","content":"I can't make any promises, but this Saturday looks like it might be good for running another Mage Oneshot at 2:00 EST. Hit me up in a PM if you're interested.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T14:43:05-07:00","id":1077235,"title":"","content":"Drat. Wish I could join you, but I'll probably still be asleep at the time (I usually don't wake up until 3-5 pm). Also, this weekend I'll be visiting my family. Thanks for the offer though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7825-falcon777","name":"Falcon777","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}